# Electron Frontend

Module map, app flow, and renderer rules: `asher-electron` skill. Project boundaries: `AGENTS.md`.

Cursor reminder: renderer must not use Node/Electron APIs directly (use `window.asher.*` via
preload); all backend calls go through `ApplicationClient.invoke()`; do not reimplement backend
logic in JavaScript. Do not recreate retired WPF/Prism/MaterialDesign structure.
